//　貴方にもどう詫びたらいいのかわからない》
《But I neglected that most basic duty... Oh, how Mother and Grandfather would weep if they could see me now. I don't even know how to apologize.》

pt:
//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/ma02/0150390a01'>
